[
{ type: [install, upgrade]
  message: <<EOM
The translations are installed as .po files only. The website offers a
language once its compiled .mo file exists, so build them after every
install or upgrade, then reload php-fpm, which caches .mo files:

  # /usr/local/www/freshports/scripts/i18n-compile.sh
  # service php_fpm reload

i18n-compile.sh rebuilds only the .mo files whose translation changed, and
removes the cached pages for those languages. If the cache is not in
/var/db/freshports/cache, set FRESHPORTS_CACHE_DIRECTORY first.

Until this is run, a new language is not offered, and a changed one still
shows its old text.
EOM
}
]
